DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
  "PGstandard.pl",
  "MathObjects.pl",
  "AnswerFormatHelp.pl",
  "PGML.pl",
  "PGcourse.pl"
);
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
TEXT(beginproblem()); 

Context('Matrix');

$A = Matrix([
[non_zero_random(-5,5,1),non_zero_random(-5,5,1)],
[0,non_zero_random(-5,5,1)],
]);

BEGIN_PGML

Let
[``A = [$A].``]

If possible, compute the following.
If an answer does not exist, enter DNE.

As you might guess: [`A^2 = AA`] and [`A^3 = AAA`].

[`A^2 = `] [___]{$A*$A}

[`A^3 = `] [___]{$A*$A*$A}

[@ AnswerFormatHelp("matrices") @]*
END_PGML




ENDDOCUMENT();